# ==============================================================================
# DevSecOps Monorepo - Trivy Vulnerability & Misconfiguration Allowlist (.trivyignore)
# ==============================================================================
#
# POLICY:
# - All exceptions must include: CVE ID, affected package, reason/justification, and review date.
# - Broad ignores (e.g. ignoring entire severity classes) are strictly prohibited.
# - Exceptions are reviewed periodically against upstream vendor patches.
#
# Format:
# <CVE-ID> # <Package> - <Justification> (Review: YYYY-MM-DD)
# ==============================================================================

# Debian 13 base image unpatched upstream perl-base issues (Status: fix_deferred / affected by Debian Security Team)
# Identity service runs purely on Python Gunicorn/Django; perl binaries are unused in application execution.
CVE-2026-13221 # perl-base - Unpatched upstream in Debian 13 (Review: 2026-12-31)
CVE-2026-42496 # perl-base - Path traversal in archive-tar fix_deferred upstream in Debian (Review: 2026-12-31)
CVE-2026-8376 # perl-base - Regex compilation overflow unpatched upstream in Debian (Review: 2026-12-31)
